{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"6590","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v2878","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"梅鳥うりり(福永ユミ、福永由美)","creatorId":"vndb:s1081","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:15748","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1081","name":"梅鳥うりり(福永ユミ、福永由美)","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:12879","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"ぽよぷよさん","creatorId":"egs:creator:3970","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3970","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:3970","name":"ぽよぷよさん","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:14281","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"森○","creatorId":"egs:creator:3671","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3671","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:3671","name":"森○","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:12880","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"筒井香織(tutti)","creatorId":"vndb:s1117","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2689","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1117","name":"筒井香織(tutti)","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:15779","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"SOFTWAX","creatorId":"vndb:s53827","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s53827","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s53827","name":"SOFTWAX","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:38542","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"柚木まき","creatorId":"vndb:s1631","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:12570","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1631","name":"柚木まき","detail":"主題歌「たんぶるガールズ」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:116762","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"梅鳥うりり(福永ユミ、福永由美)","creatorId":"vndb:s1081","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:15748","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1081","name":"梅鳥うりり(福永ユミ、福永由美)","roleCode":"character-design","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:14280","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"柚木 まき","creatorId":"vndb:s1631","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1631","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1631","name":"柚木 まき","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:38540","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"江幡 育子","creatorId":"vndb:s4458","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4458","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4458","name":"江幡 育子","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:38541","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c11898","characterName":"岬 蓮香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"96062","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"440268"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26086"],"vndbCharacterId":"c11898"},"originalCharacterName":"岬 蓮香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Suddenly appearing out of nowhere, charging headlong. Leaving behind baffling remarks or causing a ruckus, this mysterious character stirs up chaos before vanishing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"More fundamentally off-kilter than the other heroines?? (Her profession is voice actress, playing the role of “Tetsuko,” an idol admired by Koromi, a well-known figure in the industry.)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she has her adorable moments, both in appearance and personality, but fundamentally, she has an overbearing, competitive personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She refuses to admit her own mistakes, declaring “I'll go my own way!” Her forceful, overbearing manner often leaves the protagonist flustered. She takes pride in calling herself a “clumsy girl.” But the truth behind that is..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11898"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"突然現れてふらふらと体当たりをしては、周囲をひっかき回して去っていく謎の女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体は、業界でも有名な人気声優だったりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛らしい面もあるのだが、基本的には「我が道を独走する！」タイプで、その強引な言動に、主人公もたじろいでしまうこともしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の人と違い、自ら「ドジっ娘」を誇っているが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26086","sourceWorkId":"6590","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本はあっさり、サバサバした性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何処にでもいる普通の娘。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"96062"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26086","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e3974ef175362a7fe9a2b98990d3391b0630a0d482a1191eaf23590f8edebab.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/115e172bdbf2fe4c564e547c3b214cff635559c2f1600607895b297b87afb8ed.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"蓮香","creatorId":"vndb:s1682","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1682","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1682","name":"蓮香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:440268:96062:21086:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c12401","characterName":"三毛小路 弥依","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"131276","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"440268"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26087"],"vndbCharacterId":"c12401"},"originalCharacterName":"三毛小路 弥依","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"91"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The young lady of the Mikenokouji family. To outsiders, she appears slightly old-fashioned(?) and has an elegant air about her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Wanting to be of service to others(?), she begins working part-time at a convenience store under the same family's group. She personally intends to hide her identity and work incognito, but she's spectacularly obvious about it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"True to her appearance, she's exceptionally bad at lies and deception. As she becomes more conscious of the protagonist, her shyness and timid nature regarding romance lead to trouble..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's the most gentle-natured heroine, and doesn't seem particularly bothered by frequently tripping or failing. But is her ability to suddenly trip even on flat ground a natural talent?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12401"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"古風で品のある雰囲気を持つ、三毛小路家のご令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「人の役に立ちたい」という思いから、グループ傘下のコンビニで、バイトを始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はお忍びでバイトをしているつもりだが、ウソやごまかしが苦手なため、本人以外にはバレバレ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"段差のない所でも華麗に転べる所は、生まれ持った天性の素質ゆえ？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26087","sourceWorkId":"6590","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"三毛小路家の令嬢。端からみたら、少し古風（?）で品のある雰囲気のコンビニ店員の娘。「何か人のお役に立ちたい」、と同家のグループ傘下のコンビニでアルバイトを始める。本人的には素性を隠し、お忍びのつもりでバイトをしているが、見事なバレバレっぷり。主人公を意識していくにつれ、恋愛に奥手なところと内気な性格は災いして大変なことに…ヒロインの中で一番おっとりした性格で、頻繁に転んだり失敗してしまうことを、とりわけ悩んでいる様子も無い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"131276"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26087","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"161 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26087","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26087","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"52 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26087","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a45c67f49f30c0867212a6291fc71315baf95d44311b2b6ec3f76e4064fd452.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68e36684e3f914219b685620de741924f5f33424d97283afd696f5b29f737e8d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鳴海エリカ","creatorId":"vndb:s112","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s112","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s112","name":"鳴海 エリカ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:440268:131276:4489:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c12402","characterName":"藍原 転","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"131273","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"440268"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26083"],"vndbCharacterId":"c12402"},"originalCharacterName":"藍原 転","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A student at the same university as the protagonist. Belongs to the Psychology Research Club on campus."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likable to everyone, with a gentle and approachable personality. Naturally clumsy and absent-minded."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tends to space out and zone out when left alone, possessing a laid-back nature. Those around her understand this side of her and adjust their pace to accommodate her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She herself is oblivious and doesn't seem to mind... Essentially a kind-hearted girl who enjoys looking after others, but her cluelessness frequently causes trouble for those around her. She then apologizes relentlessly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's meddlesome but seems to mean no harm. She trips often. After falling, her personality inexplicably becomes rough. Possesses a dual personality (?!)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12402"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じ大学に通う学生で、心理学研究会に所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天性のボケっぷりを持つが、優しく人当たりが良いため、誰からも好かれるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人の面倒を見るのが好きなのだが、そのニブさ故、度々周りを困らせ、その度にしつこい程に謝り倒す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"転んだ後は、何故か性格が荒くなるようだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26083","sourceWorkId":"6590","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じ大学の学生。誰にでも好かれ、優しく人当たりの良い性格。天性のボケっぷりの持ち主。放っておくと一人ぼーっとすることが多いのんびりした性格。周囲の人間も、そんな転の性格を理解した上でペースを合わせて接してくれている。本人は鈍感なので気にしていないようだが…。他人の面倒を見るのが好きな本質的には性格の良い娘だがそのニブさ故、度々まわりに迷惑を掛けてはしつこい程に謝り倒してくる。よく転ぶ。転んだ後は『何故か』性格が荒くなる二重人格（!?）の持ち主。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"131273"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26083","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"161 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26083","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26083","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"51 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26083","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c517be5eb365718d7f5d3bb1ca8a67742d74bdf0a92793de2070a0f51ac673b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/69714922d99d35e414de76b717b8306cda4a094a5c8555bdf1b8284eae07a2d9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永田佳代","creatorId":"vndb:s266","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s266","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s266","name":"永田 佳代","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:440268:131273:6038:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c12445","characterName":"大和 ころみ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"131274","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"440268"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26085"],"vndbCharacterId":"c12445"},"originalCharacterName":"大和 ころみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"73"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"74"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"46"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Vocational school student. Dreaming of becoming an anime voice actress, currently studying. A slightly otaku-ish girl who loves anime and manga."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Started working part-time at a maid cafe simply because she admired cosplay. Her personality is just full of energy. She's always giggling and brightens up those around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a bit scatterbrained. She's always tripping over something and falling down a lot. She has a (cute design) bandage on her cheek."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She constantly has fresh scrapes. She never misses even the tiniest dip! If there's even the slightest step, she'll definitely trip."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As the story progresses, she becomes like a little sister to the protagonist, always trotting along behind him like a puppy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12445"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アニメなどの声優を目指して勉強中の専門学校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とにかく元気でいつもコロコロ笑い、周囲を明るくさせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に注意散漫で、いつでも何かにつまづいては転ぶため、生傷が絶えない本格派ドジっ娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その転ぶ確率は、小さな溝も見逃さず確実に転ぶ、いわば転びのプロ（!?）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の後ろをちょこちょこついて来る、妹のような存在。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26085","sourceWorkId":"6590","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"専門学校生。アニメ声優を夢見て、現在勉強中。アニメやマンガが好きなちょっぴりオタク気味の娘。性格はとにかく元気。いつもコロコロと笑い、周囲を明るくさせる。注意散漫なところがあり、いつも何かに躓いてはよく転んでいる。物語が進むにつれ、主人公にとって妹的な存在となり、いつも後ろをテクテクとついてくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"131274"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"73 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26085","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"153 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26085","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"74 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26085","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"46 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26085","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d9f07c6e0819320942d22d201a2d439540abc4536e08a28689fb6648b52b6b14.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9dc8fc1239013c201d62769092b7656b444b322aee70875bf303a91234dddb5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"壱智村小真","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:440268:131274:4830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c12446","characterName":"新里 奈菜子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"131275","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"440268"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26084"],"vndbCharacterId":"c12446"},"originalCharacterName":"新里 奈菜子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"99"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An older sister figure who lives nearby and is the protagonist's childhood friend. An alumna of the university the protagonist attends. During her time there, she belonged to the same club as the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Currently helping out with the family business (a bookstore) while job hunting, hoping to move out and become independent. She appears older and dependable, but is actually quite scatterbrained, creating a stark contrast with her sharp, beautiful appearance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She aspires to be a “sharp, sophisticated older sister” with a slightly pretentious air, but her reality is far from her ideal .She absolutely refuses to admit this."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's so clumsy she often bangs her head on walls or pillars... She's quite uncoordinated, unable to control her own body well. The protagonist ends up taking care of her most of the time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12446"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"近所に住む、お姉さん的存在の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は、稼業（書店）を手伝いながら就職活動の真っ最中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見、キリっとしたしっかり者の「大人の女性」に見えるが、その実、かなり高レベルのおっちょこちょい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の身体をうまく制御できないほどの運動オンチで、壁や柱によくぶつかるため、主人公が面倒を見ることが多い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26084","sourceWorkId":"6590","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"近所に住む、主人公とは幼なじみのお姉さん的存在。主人公の通う大学のOG。現在は家業（書店）を手伝いながら、家を出て独立したいと就職活動中。年上でしっかり者に見えるが、実はかなりのおっちょこちょいで、キリリとした美人といった外見とのギャップがかなり激しい。本人はちょっと気取った雰囲気のある「キレのある姉さん」を目指しているが理想とは程遠い現状。…であることを本人は絶対に認めないが。自分の身体を上手く制御できない、かなりの運動オンチ。もっぱら主人公が面倒を見ることが多い始末。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"131275"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"99 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26084","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"170 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26084","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26084","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26084","sourceWorkId":"6590","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/term